{
  "id": "topo-ahb-apb-bridge",
  "title": "AHB to APB Bridge",
  "description": "An AHB-to-APB bridge sits as a slave on the fast AHB bus, but acts as the single master for the slower APB bus. It bridges the timing gap between the two domains.",
